      "text": "◆【陨石】：Lv5，不明；不可交易",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆流星山丘行走路线：",
      "type": "media-caption",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3..通过迷宫抵达流星山丘之顶，前往大地鼠婆婆之家（57.42）。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "夜晚/清晨，与爱鼠的老婆婆（12.9）对话，交出【陨石】、【入场许可证】获得【流星】。",
      "type": "limited-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆【流星】：Lv.5，宝石；可交易",
      "type": "gem-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "合成时，加入武器：必杀+3，攻击-6%；加入防具：闪躲+3，防御-6%",
      "type": "gem-synthesis",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆【流星】兑换说明：",
      "type": "exchange-rule-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "⑴一个夜晚只有一颗【陨石】会被鉴定为【流星】，即第一个玩家与爱鼠的老婆婆对话交出的那颗。",
      "type": "global-limit",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "⑵若当晚唯一的【流星】被别的玩家换完，与爱鼠的老婆婆对话会被告知【陨石】为假",
      "type": "limit-failure",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "⑶拿到【入场许可证】的时间＜60分钟才能兑换。",
      "type": "timer-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "4.前往奇利村装备店（66.77），持有【陨石】或【流星】与城府深的女人雀儿（8.4）对话，交出【陨石】或【流星】获得【流星的耳饰】，任务完结。",
      "type": "alternative-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆【流星的耳饰】：Lv.4，耳环，耐久150~200；敏捷+3~+5，魅力+1~+3，抗石化-1~-3；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆【流星的耳饰】兑换说明：",
      "type": "exchange-rule-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "⑴持有【流星的耳饰】时无法与城府深的女人雀儿再兑换，若需兑换多条，可将物品栏内的【流星的耳饰】丢地，再与之对话兑换",
      "type": "inventory-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "⑵物品栏内有【流星】及多颗【陨石】时，注意将【流星】放与【陨石】后，防止误兑换",
      "type": "ordering-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "黄金树精支线：",
      "type": "side-quest-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "1.黄金树精支线在流星山丘300公尺处往西边下山前往饲养师训练所（148.199），",
      "type": "side-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "职业为封印师、驯兽师、饲养师与饲养师师父（15.7）对话，交出1000G购买快枯死的树精。",
      "type": "career-purchase",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆饲养师训练所抵达路线：",
      "type": "media-caption",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "2.将快枯死的树精等级提升至Lv.20，返回饲养师训练所与饲养师傅对话，交出快枯死的树精，获得1只Lv.1黄金树精，支线完结。",
